Security/no-claim proof for WP21:

- Child copy is schema-backed in text-domain and checked for banned blame,
  AI-attribution, executable/path, and private diagnostic fragments.
- Child-facing cards reject private diagnostic references.
- Parent-rule explanations require evidence refs.
- Ask-parent/request-more-time cards require approval request, child reason,
  child status, and evidence refs.
- Manual-required and unavailable child states cannot claim adapter action refs.
- No process paths, command lines, raw evidence payloads, screenshots, tokens,
  journal rows, SQLite rows, or parent-only diagnostics are added to
  child-facing payloads.
